  """
  Raise a lock on the component or the branch, with the failing release and every
  unrecognized commit in it as causes. Unlike every other action, its effect outlives the
  release that fired it -- which is the point: a rule about a commit is otherwise defeated
  by pushing another commit on top of it.
  """
